sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Developer
    participant LB as GLB + Cloud Armor
    participant SQ as SonarQube
    participant KC as Keycloak (realm qa)
    participant UP as Entra ID
    actor CI as GitHub Actions

    rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
    Note over U,UP: People: SAML 2.0 SP-initiated. No OIDC SecurityPolicy on the route
    U->>LB: GET https://sonar.qa.disasterproject.com
    LB->>SQ: via Envoy Gateway
    SQ-->>U: 302 to Keycloak (AuthnRequest)
    U->>KC: sign in
    KC->>UP: OIDC redirect (broker)
    Note over UP: login + MFA + conditional access
    UP-->>KC: id_token with roles claim (app roles)
    KC->>KC: roles → groups mapper
    KC-->>U: POST SAMLResponse (login, email, groups)
    U->>SQ: POST /oauth2/callback/saml
    SQ->>SQ: validates signature, syncs groups
    SQ-->>U: session
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over CI,SQ: Machines: project analysis token (repo secret)
    CI->>LB: POST /api/ce/submit · Bearer squ_…
    LB->>SQ: same route
    SQ-->>CI: task id (queued for the single CE worker)
    CI->>SQ: poll the quality gate (qualitygate.wait)
    SQ-->>CI: OK / ERROR → job passes or fails
    end
